g"->"Minimum and maximum after flattening. Only meaningful for mutually comparable elements, usually numbers."|>,"Preview"-><|"Value"->Take[lst,UpTo[10]],"Meaning"->"First elements of the list, to avoid printing a huge object immediately."|>,"FullArray"-><|"Value"->lst,"Meaning"->"The complete original object."|>|>];*)
